OL,3,GNEWSAFire-hit church repairs may take
OL,4,Ayears, says priest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA priest has said it could take about
OL,7,Ffive years to repair a church in
OL,8,FLeicester which was damaged in a fire
OL,9,Fearlier this year.
OL,11,FSt Andrew's Church in Jarrom Street was
OL,12,Fbadly damaged on 28 July in a fire
OL,13,Fthought to have been started
OL,14,Faccidentally.
OL,16,FHistoric England placed the Grade II*
OL,17,Fbuilding on the heritage at risk
OL,18,Fregister following the blaze which
OL,19,Fcaused severe damage to the roof.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
