OL,3,GNEWSAFire-hit church repairs may take
OL,4,Ayears, says priest
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking to the BBC, Father Johannes
OL,7,FArens, parish priest at St Andrew's
OL,8,FChurch, said the roof of the building
OL,9,Fhad been "stabilised", but it would
OL,10,Ftake a "huge amount of time" to repair
OL,11,Fthe 164-year-old building.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
